BT /F1 11 Tf 56 770 Td 15 TL (Harbor Point Pump Station: Operating Procedure, Version 2 \(page 1 of 3\)) Tj T* () Tj T* (Scope. This procedure covers pumps P-101 and P-102 at the Harbor Point pump station. It) Tj T* (applies to all operators and maintenance staff.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The shift supervisor owns this procedure and reviews it every 6 months.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Operators must hold a valid permit to work before starting any maintenance task.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Visitors are not allowed in the pump hall without an escort.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Contractors must complete the site induction before entering the pump hall.) Tj T* () Tj ET
