stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 770 Td 15 TL (Isolation before maintenance \(page 2 of 3\)) Tj T* () Tj T* (Operators must close the suction valve before the discharge valve.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Operators must lock out the pump motor at the breaker and attach a personal lock.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The pressure gauge must read below 0.5 bar before any flange is opened.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Operators must take a photo of the gauge reading before and after isolation.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Operators should wait 30 minutes after shutdown before touching the pump casing.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Three people must confirm the lock-out on the permit.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Never open a flange while the line is still pressurized.) Tj T* () Tj ET
endstream
endobj
