stream
BT /F1 11 Tf 56 770 Td 15 TL (Emergency shutdown and records \(page 3 of 3\)) Tj T* () Tj T* (Press the red emergency stop button on panel A to stop both pumps.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Call the control room on extension 4420 within 1 minute.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Log every shutdown in the pump logbook with the time and the reason.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The logbook must be kept for 7 years.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Operators should inspect the seal for leakage once per shift.) Tj T* () Tj ET
endstream
